<%- include('layout-header', { title: 'Game Rules', active: 'rules' }) %>
<div class="content-box">
  <h3>Game Rules</h3>
  <div style="color:#666;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;">
    <p style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:#1a1a1a;">1. One inmate per person.</strong> No spam, cheating, begging or harassment.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:#1a1a1a;">2. Duplicate accounts</strong> are merged and blocked from trading and combat.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:#1a1a1a;">3. Keep it clean.</strong> No offensive language in shoutbox or forums.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:#1a1a1a;">4. No real money trading.</strong> All transactions must use in-game currency.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:#1a1a1a;">5. Have fun!</strong> This is a game, don't take it too seriously.</p>
  </div>
</div>
